---
// Anonymized case study — a Caribbean streaming retailer running Relay in production.
---

<section class="case-sec section" aria-label="Case study">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel glass-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="panel-head">
        <span class="kicker">Case study</span>
        <span class="chip live">RELAY · IN PRODUCTION</span>
      </div>
      <h2>A Caribbean streaming retailer<br /><span class="grad-text">stopped missing customers.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Their leads arrive from Meta ads straight into WhatsApp — at lunch, at midnight, during
        the match. Relay answers every single one, collects the order, and only calls a human
        when a human is actually needed.
      </p>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num"><span data-countup="1000" data-suffix="s">1,000s</span></span>
          <span class="stat-label mono">CONVERSATIONS HANDLED BY AI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num">11 PM <span class="arrow">→</span> instant</span>
          <span class="stat-label mono">RESPONSE TIME, AFTER HOURS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num"><span data-countup="24" data-suffix="/7">24/7</span></span>
          <span class="stat-label mono">EVERY LEAD ANSWERED</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="handoff" data-reveal>
        <span class="handoff-title mono">AND WHEN THE AI SHOULDN'T ANSWER —</span>
        <div class="handoff-row">
          <span class="chip amber">⚠ ESCALATED — customer asked for a human</span>
          <span class="handoff-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          <span class="handoff-text">AI pauses itself. A person closes the conversation. That honesty is a feature.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .case-sec { background: var(--ink-950); }
  .panel {
    padding: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 100% at 85% 0%, oklch(0.58 0.23 285 / 0.09), transparent 55%),
      var(--glass);
  }
  .panel-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .panel h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .panel .lead { margin-bottom: 2.4rem; }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--text-100);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .stat-num .arrow { color: var(--teal-300); }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--text-500); }

  .handoff { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .handoff-title { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--text-500); }
  .handoff-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .handoff-arrow { color: var(--text-500); }
  .handoff-text { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-300); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
